# Pairs with StaleEpochNeverAppends. After a WAL shard restart, or L's clear,
# the shard has no loaded entry for L. Accepting an append from a leaf whose entry
# is not loaded, instead of rejecting it until the leaf re-presents its claim,
# accepts a superseded or retired activation's epoch.
MODULE: StaleEpochNeverAppendsUnloadedEntryAccepted
TARGET: StaleEpochNeverAppends
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the shard accepts an append whose entry it has not loaded
PERTURBS: OwnAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ memFence # Unloaded
    /\ AppendAdmits(a)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an unloaded entry does not hold the append.
    /\ AppendAdmits(a)
--- END
